Package: atelente
Type: Package
Title: Quantitative Analysis of Neo-Terminal and Spanning Peptides
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Enver", "Ozturk", email = "enver.ozturk@metu.edu.tr",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0004-8359-8032"))
Description: Maps observed peptides to reference sequences, links neo-terminal
    and spanning forms at candidate cleavage bonds, and calculates ratios when
    both forms are quantified in the same sample. Intended primarily for
    shotgun proteomics without terminal peptide enrichment.
Depends: R (>= 4.3.0)
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: stats, utils, digest, jsonlite, curl, zip
Suggests: limma, openxlsx, readxl, shiny, writexl
